-- Smash history: the sets of 2014's Melee majors, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (round 734's way;
-- Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of these brackets, not every set; scores as it
-- lists them (none where it only marks the winner). MLG Anaheim 2014 has no bracket there. Made with
-- tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from tools/liquipedia/brackets/2014-melee.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2014-apex-2014 (melee): 10 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/Apex/2014/Melee/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

